        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AD-A5, Elite Collection Drop Tail Lever with Ketme Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Drop Tail Lever with Ketme Rose has a classic silhouette that brings an element of elegance to any room. Easy to install, the Drop Tail Leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in 5 finishes including brushed nickel (pictured right), polished brass, and oil rubbed bronze. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AD-A5 Traditional Drop-Tail Lever with Ketme Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion lever spring assembly for lifetime performance.</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish.</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose cover.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Solid Brass Drop Tail Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: The Single Dummy Function is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Drop Tail Lever with Ketme Rose, Fusion AD-A5",
                "description": "Fusion AD-A5, Drop Tail Lever with Ketme Rose - The Drop Tail Lever with Ketme Rose has a classic silhouette that brings an element of elegance to any room. Easy to install, the Drop Tail Leverset will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is available in 5 finishes including brushed nickel, polished brass, and oil rubbed bronze. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.",
